<title>UK: Morland buys restaurants from Allied.</title>
<headline>Morland buys restaurants from Allied.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK pub owner Morland Plc said on Thursday it is had agreed to buy 24 Exchange bar restaurants from Allied Domecq Plc for 32.0 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that it has agreed to acquire 16 pubs from Whitbread Plc for 3.4 million stg in cash.</p>
</text>
